{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2012-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1337126400, "end_date": 1337817599, "month_true_total": 37, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:46:07 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "2658239", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010623202", "personaname": "saladful", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/saladful/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 3162, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3146, "last_played": 1587295768, "avatar": "b0ae6db48593feceed9117cb327fba91a9f07c64"}, "language": "english", "review": "HUGE-simulator 40.000!", "timestamp_created": 1337771789, "timestamp_updated": 1337771789, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "461080", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970790497", "personaname": "Amber Light", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RachelFreakingAmber/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 3792, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2919, "last_played": 1493066072, "avatar": "b3e3a8d24c8577b6990a87dd266a5be18bd36373"}, "language": "english", "review": "I will be honest, I knew little to nothing about the Warhammer franchise until I played this. The game feels good with a decent campaign, lots of weapons (both melee and ranged) and just enough different enemies. If you are done playing the campaign (which takes quite a few hours), jump into multiplayer to face off against other players in Versus in standard DM or Domination matches or play Exterminatus, the game's cooperative survival mode. This mode in particular makes this game very interesting to play with friends as it will force you to teamwork unlike any other game I have ever played.\n\nThe only gripe is the peer to peer multiplayer system, so make sure you got buddies  with good pings to play with! Also some unlocks can only be gained in Versus matches. Other than that, its definately a good game and an awesome coop experience in Exterminatus.\n\nLet's slay some Orks!", "timestamp_created": 1337689606, "timestamp_updated": 1337689606, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3527631", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024229223", "personaname": "Alith-Ahnar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198024229223/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1585, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1585, "last_played": 1459087872, "avatar": "bbbefcb6642830c8eb9ad8ae98b8f8c475d20d54"}, "language": "english", "review": "Still the most Kickass hack'n Slay 1st person shooter crossover!\n\nThe only thing that could make this game even more Epic would be a sequel.", "timestamp_created": 1337684811, "timestamp_updated": 1542836975, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2058320", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001606478", "personaname": "Tote Baggs Tanuki", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198001606478/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 1301, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1008, "last_played": 1654325184, "avatar": "df9b9402ee46416607f60fc75e588950b9fb66ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "For da emporah!, though i would liek some Green D.A.T.S. armor ,, that woudl be fastasitc", "timestamp_created": 1337503732, "timestamp_updated": 1337503732, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1229340", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989672987", "personaname": "Poulsen", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197989672987/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1921, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1544, "last_played": 1724257215, "avatar": "17125835b289d531654cff54b202dd4748ac4438"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you are a Warhammer 40.000 fan you have probably already bought this, but for all you uninitiated out there.\nThe Warhammer universe is simply awesome, the game it self could have done some things better, but all in all it does really well. RPG and lore wise this a great game.\nRecommendable to both fans of the genre and for people who just want to rip stuff apart. 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1337451673, "timestamp_updated": 1337451673, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}